    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="b7bc1c95-700c-5470-b795-55b6e3b5b5b2" activityNameId="844de89d-79cd-54d1-816c-42516cdbd3f1" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Frame extension, particle board, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Frame extension, particle board, at plant
The frame extension is 0.064m thick, U=0.5W/m2K. 1m2 of frame extension weighs 17.8kg. The bill of materials is based on data from frame extension manufactures.;
UUID: 7a7ceb6c-168d-34a5-965c-0e9ae2e661ed
Included are the materials used in a frame extension. The cover plate is a coated particle board. Production losses, work materials, packaging materials, energy demand and the transport of the materials are also included.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at frame extenstion manufactures in Switzerland. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7a7ceb6c-168d-34a5-965c-0e9ae2e661ed.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
